      "content": "Welcome to Module 2 of the Baby First Health Early Childhood Development Certificate.\n\n\nIn this module, you will learn what physical development means, how children build movement skills from birth to age five, and how you can safely support a child’s physical abilities through everyday play, nutrition, sleep, and responsive care.\n\n\nBy the end, you should be able to explain physical development, understand gross and fine motor skills, use milestones as helpful guides rather than deadlines, and know when to seek professional advice.\n\n### Learning Objectives\n\n- Explain what physical development is\n- Understand gross and fine motor skills\n- Use milestones as helpful guides rather than deadlines\n- Know when to seek professional advice",
